  [1mRAZORPOWER CO.  //  NOVARE KALIUM OPERATION[0m

  On its initial journey, the ICARUS left drills behind on NOVARE.
  They are piloted remotely from here, mining KALIUM: a very powerful
  and unique ore. KALIUM needs special attention to mine. Once a deposit
  is found, the drill must be handed a specific drill input sequence
  (DIS). Mining is tricky, but the basic sensors on each DCU give you the
  approximate shape of the stone.

  Three DRILL CONTAINMENT UNITS are mining remotely on NOVARE.

  Access Console:  dcu          (menu)
                   dcu status   (unit status)
                   dcu <1-3>    (enter a unit)

